{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "867d18ac-7e0a-8a48-85ef-dd3918db62ea",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:28:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Neusa Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:27:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Tony, and peace to you. I hope your day is going well. I am sorry to trouble you at lunchtime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:27:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you are very kind. So, I am calling about the water and sewer bill at 47 Eustis Avenue. I rent there, I am the tenant. And my landlord tells me that I must pay this bill. I do not think this is right. Whose bill is it, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:27:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The city bills the property owner, so the bill is in the landlord's name. If your lease says you pay it, that's between you two, but the account is theirs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:27:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, I see. It is still annoying, I must say. Also, my daughter helps me with the bills, she is better with the computer. Can she be authorized to talk to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since the account isn't in your name, she'd need the owner's okay. I can note it if the owner calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:28:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. One more thing. Can the website take a card payment right now, late in the day, or only in office hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:28:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The website takes cards any time, day or night. The drop box outside City Hall works too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now I must go. I need new shoelaces and I keep putting it off. Thank you, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:28:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go get those laces. Take care."
    }
  ],
